        "Choose one function you own with at least one limit and one error mode. Write a 7-check mini-suite in one file: happy path, empty/zero edge, below/on/above boundary triple, error type-plus-message, and one regression case named for a real past bug. Run it to a full green tally and keep the file as your suite template.",
        ["def ", "passed", "except ValueError"],
