            'class BudgetExceeded(Exception):\n    pass\n\ndef poll_first(ready, budget):\n    for i in range(1, budget + 1):\n        if ready(i):\n            return i\n    raise BudgetExceeded(f"not ready within {budget} polls")\n\nprint(("PASS" if poll_first(lambda i: i >= 3, 10) == 3 else "FAIL") + ": ready on third")\nassert poll_first(lambda i: i >= 3, 10) == 3\ntry:\n    poll_first(lambda i: False, 4)\n    raise SystemExit("should raise")\nexcept BudgetExceeded as e:\n    print(f"PASS: budget enforced -> {e}")\n    assert "4" in str(e)\nprint("hangs impossible")',
